Hi:

Ubuntu was carrying a "hildon" patch to make the bluetooth-properties =
application fit on smaller form factors for lpia.  We've adapted the =
patch to be applicable to all platforms.  It changes the layout of the =
bluetooth-properties window to be better for small displays without a =
loss of functionality.

Regards

